", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001729_688757979474487_372831043915449376_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=80bN2TqvdSAQ7kNvwEJA4ny&_nc_oc=AdrA-ufv0KxzF7JWMsInRzuZnz-EpeDU5j8vtS6rB9z7TMq75n6DOpp-yvU60B7V8LM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLlE3ssiDVuvPrht5R83Z89LKC_FGn4u0CGiLlFoCrZ_A&oe=6AAE8BB0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "9.png", "id": "812515083888727", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974794_812515087222060_3028579936202036671_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I-Hwv7_2PhAQ7kNvwEQMbke&_nc_oc=AdrCMUjggybGpAUzatOfKJtCb6HQz-xp0uxtvz8nitP-wxFLPU50ciV6sWbAPyTZcsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ_CdsGBk0vwyLCnIM6AhXrDTdxAZ2BX0Jl0apDRboMKw&oe=6AAEA766"}, "display_name": "Pickleball Pro - Early Access", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Early Access Alert: Unleash your inner Pickleball Pro!\n\nAvailable Now:\n\nDive into specialized mini-games designed to master the art of dinks, drops, and powerful slams.\n\nTest your skills against our 8.0 DUPR practice wall\u2014your ultimate sparring partner that never gets tired.\n\nHarness the power of a fully customizable ball machine. Engineer the perfect shot, set the spin, angle, and speed, then let it rip!\n\nComing Soon:\n\nGet ready to face off in high-stakes single-player and multiplayer matches. Scheduled for release in 2024. NOTE: These modes are under development and not included in the current Early Access package.\n\n\ud83d\udd25Pricing Alert: The value-packed Early Access price is a limited-time offer. Upon the release of more content including single-player and multi-player modes in 2024, the game's price will jump considerably. Get in now to enjoy future upgrades at no extra cost!", "short_description": "This is the EARLY ACCESS version of the worlds ultimate Pickleball simulator!\n\nAvailable Now:\n\nDive into training mini-games for dinks, drops, slams, and a practice wall. In addition to a fully configurable ball machine that can throw out any shot you can create.\n\nComing Soon:\n\nPickleball Pro will include single-player and multi-player matches but this is not currently part of the early access version.\n\nWhen single-player and multi-player modes are released the price of the app will increase."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.elevenvr.com/en/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.elevenvr.com/en/tos/", "publisher_name": "For Fun Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pball.pro/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1062640004900180"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 21, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2305397433541431"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1799207154590010"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1442879471008545"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1012694391097181"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "823927640154425"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1449092636866540"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "861880413276817"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1206033734489560"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "873431615234793"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "618190991383495"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3398633873611304"}, {"status": "PUBL